1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:01,852
(Penny:)- All right?
- All right.

2
00:00:02,016 --> 00:00:04,806
(Penny:)Oh, my God,
would you just get off my case?

3
00:00:07,564 --> 00:00:09,234
(Penny:)- Weird.
- Oh, good.

4
00:00:09,399 --> 00:00:12,649
(Sheldon:)That was an unusual interaction.
I wasn't sure.

5
00:00:13,903 --> 00:00:16,693
(Leonard:)- You guys have an argument?
- No.

6
00:00:16,865 --> 00:00:19,535
(Leonard:)You clearly did something
to aggravate her.

7
00:00:19,701 --> 00:00:21,081
SHELDON:
I'm at a loss.

8
00:00:21,244 --> 00:00:25,204
(Sheldon:)If you like, you can review my daily log
of social interactions...

9
00:00:25,373 --> 00:00:28,253
(Sheldon:)...and see if there's a blunder
I overlooked.

10
00:00:29,711 --> 00:00:30,841
(Leonard:)Here you go.

11
00:00:31,004 --> 00:00:33,884
Oh, you owe me another $2.
The price of moo shu pork went up.

12
00:00:34,048 --> 00:00:35,088
[SIGHS]

13
00:00:35,258 --> 00:00:38,598
(Howard:)It's getting tougher and tougher
to be a bad Jew.

14
00:00:40,221 --> 00:00:42,351
(Leonard:)Here you go, Penny.
Shrimp with lobster sauce.

15
00:00:42,515 --> 00:00:43,805
Thank you. What's my share?

16
00:00:43,975 --> 00:00:47,565
- Uh, don't worry about it. It's my treat.
- No, really. How much?

17
00:00:47,729 --> 00:00:49,019
It's whatever. Ten, $11.

18
00:00:49,189 --> 00:00:50,899
Well, which is it? Ten or 11?

19
00:00:51,065 --> 00:00:53,065
Fourteen-fifty. But it's no biggie.

20
00:00:53,735 --> 00:00:55,655
(Leonard:)You'll get the next one.

21
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,860
[BOTH LAUGH]

22
00:00:58,573 --> 00:01:00,023
(Penny:)What?

